%GNAT_arches %{GPRbuild_arches} ia64 ppc alpha %{arm}
# GNAT_arches lists architectures where GNAT is available from the distro GCC
# stack. Ada packages will not build on other architectures until GNAT is
# bootstrapped for them.
# (Keep this list aligned with the one in gcc.spec for this family when practical.)

%GPRbuild_arches %{ix86} x86_64 %{power64} s390x aarch64 riscv64
# GPRbuild_arches lists architectures where GPRbuild is available. If an
# architecture is in GNAT_arches but not GPRbuild_arches, GPRbuild is not
# bootstrapped there or there is an arch-specific blocker.
